Design Stage:

The first task of the design stage was creating a system block diagram, which would later serve as the foundation for the PCB schematic. This required selecting all relevant components for the system. The chosen components were as follows:

1. A STM32 MPU (STM32F401)
2. A motor Controller (TB6612)
3. Two DC Motors (DC Gearbox TT Motor)
4. A IMU (MPU 6050)
5. A Wifi Controller (ESP 8266)
6. A controllable RGB LED (WS2811)
7. An Encoder (MT6701)
8. A User LED
9. A USB-C input
10. A ST-Link Conection
11. Power Componentry (LDOs)

With the components decided the Pinouts were decided in STM Cube MX, where each periferal could be configured.
